  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b><br></p></div></div><p>늦었지만 구름 동영상 올려요. 유튜브에서 찾은 자료예요.</p><p>내년 수업에 참고하세요. ^^</p><p><iframe id=\"vf46dDedXdr89wP59DkPaYa\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vf46dDedXdr89wP59DkPaYa?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZmNDZkRGVkWGRyODl3UDU5RGtQYVlhIiwidGlkIjoiMGVlZWQ1ZmUtNmM2Ni00ZWU1LTg0YjgtNzhkY2U4MWNkNjU5IiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg1NDY1fQ.9fLBusrtwYsajbdzhgi5W-VlHB1jKidB__gnSvpy0FWMK1uvQ-qeYR_W1MECpDplLSx_ItM-L1s077RjYV6aew&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"vce302Zyx8g4llb0I4cbcgy\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vce302Zyx8g4llb0I4cbcgy?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZjZTMwMlp5eDhnNGxsYjBJNGNiY2d5IiwidGlkIjoiOWQ1Zjg0YjYtMzk5Ny00ZWFkLTgzM2QtM2UxMGM4MTkxYTgyIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg1NDY1fQ.D1nNybSERMU94bsVoMVOvJO4VTRmFvy5oOoiNAM4cxI3W99CRNu1WSnuDmiHLLbK1WM4KYRwieu2DBEgESodnA&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- --